    "text": "allaboutkingfisher.com\nwebsite\nKingfisher\nKHS CHOIR HOSTS ANNUAL ALL-STATE WORKSHOP\n7 hours ago\nThe Kingfisher High School Choir hosted their annual all-state workshop on Saturday, Aug. 23, welcoming over 100 high school and junior high students from across Oklahoma—including Marietta, Laverne, Edmond, Guymon, Bethany, and more!. With clinicians Dr. Karsten Longhurst (OCU) and Mr. Kenneith Stock (Edmond North HS & Canterbury Youth...",
